# Task API

A RESTful Task Management API built with **Node.js**, **Express**, **PostgreSQL**, **Docker**, and **Supabase Authentication**.

This project demonstrates CRUD operations, JWT authentication, protected routes, API documentation with Swagger, and containerized deployment.

---

## Features

- User registration with Supabase Authentication
- User login
- User logout
- JWT authentication
- Protected API routes
- CRUD operations for tasks
- PostgreSQL database
- Docker support
- Swagger/OpenAPI documentation

---

## Tech Stack

- Node.js
- Express.js
- PostgreSQL
- Supabase
- Docker
- Swagger UI

