## API Endpoints

### Authentication

| Method | Endpoint |
|----------|---------------------------|
| POST | /auth/signup |
| POST | /auth/login |
| POST | /auth/logout |
| GET | /auth/me |

---

### Public

| Method | Endpoint |
|----------|-------------------------|
| GET | /public/info |

---

### Protected

| Method | Endpoint |
|----------------|-----------------------|
| GET | /protected/profile |

---

### Tasks

| Method | Endpoint |
|----------|----------------|
| GET | /tasks |
| GET | /tasks/{id} |
| POST | /tasks |
| PUT | /tasks/{id} |
| DELETE | /tasks/{id} |

---

## Authentication

Protected routes require a Bearer Token.

Example

```
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN
```

---

